nabled, there's absolutely no way to know under how many parents each node is, or at least a visible clue that the setting is enabled.\r\n\r\nTake the following hierarchy:\r\n```\r\n- Don't\r\n    - Match\r\n    - Don't\r\n          - Match\r\n    - Don't\r\n          - Don't\r\n               - Match     \r\n    - Match2 \r\n```\r\n\r\nIn the search results, I believe(?) they would display as follows:\r\n```\r\n- Don't\r\n    - Match\r\n    - Match\r\n    - Match     \r\n    - Match2 \r\n```\r\nWith multiple matching siblings, the ambiguity can be confusing. Now the question is whether this matters enough to do something about it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2463191416/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2514715229","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98926#issuecomment-2514715229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98926","id":2514715229,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6V44Jd","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_